P3-local failed design evidence, 2026-09-10

Design: move ckernel.compute_at from the conv reduction tile to an outer output loop.
Static outcome: lower succeeded and reported fewer weight LOAD calls/bytes.
FSim outcome: rejected during execution.

Initial pytest progress before interruption:
  original: W00 PASS, W02 PASS, W09 PASS
  input_stationary: W00 PASS, W02 PASS, W09 PASS
  weight_stationary: W00 FAIL, W02 FAIL, W09 FAIL
  paper_inspired_hybrid: W00 FAIL, W02 FAIL, W09 interrupted after excessive runtime

First error (W00 weight_stationary):
  TVMError: Check failed: (from != kStoreStage || to != kLoadStage) is false
  location: vta/runtime/runtime.cc:1023, VTADepPop
  interpretation: unsupported STORE -> LOAD dependency created by crossing a VTA task boundary.

Recovery applied:
